WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Thomani nnḓuni, zone ya 0. Humbulani nga fhethu hune na hu dalela lunzhi.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Vheani ngade ya khishini tsini na muṋango kha zone ya 1. Ni i dalela ḓuvha ḽiṅwe na ḽiṅwe.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Vheani miri ya mitshelo tsini kha zone ya 2. Ni i ṱhogomela maḓuvha manzhi.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Tsimu khulwane i kule kha zone ya 3. I daleleni musi zwi tshi ṱoḓea.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Dalelani ḓaka ḽa khuni kha zone ya 4 nga zwiṅwe zwifhinga. Litshani zone ya 5 i ḓaka ḽa mupo.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Maḓi, miedzi na nḓila zwi vhumba dzi-zone. Shumisani dzine dza tea shango ḽaṋu.
